                                "sense_id": "7d4aed1a-4ed7-35ec-b0fb-4aa6badd554f",
                                "text": "The scammer is paid for each new visitor directed to his site. There is nothing wrong except that the user finds it impossible to leave the site because he is mousetrapped."
